    <headline>Tribhuvan Rajpath (Kathmandu–Hetauda): one-way after landslide at Khatripauwa</headline>
    <description>Reported: the Rajpath is one-way after a landslide at Khatripauwa, Dhunibesi-9. Onlinekhabar and Onlinepana both cite Nepal Police's 6 AM notice of Asoj 27 (13 Oct 2026). Kanti Lokpath is running two-way (Ratopati, federal road office).</description>
    <instruction>Check road status with the police before travelling.</instruction>
